{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "libertos-archive-sweep",
  "title": "Libertos / Archive sweep",
  "description": "Libertos engine operations. TODO panels identify telemetry that is not exported. No data is not zero.",
  "tags": [
    "libertos",
    "engine"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 40,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Engine pipeline",
      "url": "/d/libertos-engine-pipeline",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Archive sweep",
      "url": "/d/libertos-archive-sweep",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Cost",
      "url": "/d/libertos-cost",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Briefing drill-down",
      "url": "/d/libertos-briefing-drilldown",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Archive telemetry coverage",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The existing archive_sweep span is emitted when the job terminates. Duration includes queue time and retries. It does not carry feed/article counts, completeness or the sweep deadline.\n\nAll times on this dashboard are UTC. **04:00Z is the archive deadline**, independent of reader delivery timezones."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Archive job completions per rolling hour",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-home-cluster"
      },
      "description": "Terminal archive jobs. A missing series is not a successful sweep.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-home-cluster"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (span_name) (increase(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"libertos-convex\",span_name=~\"eve[.]job[.]archive_sweep .*\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "TODO · Feeds polled and articles stored",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Requires completed-sweep feed and article counts. Do not count ingest spans as articles: one job can handle multiple items and retries."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "TODO · Full-text share",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Requires articles with usable full text divided by articles stored in the same sweep. Export both counts; no data and a zero denominator must remain unknown."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "TODO · Short cells",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Requires a count of cells below the required coverage target at sweep completion, with bounded reason codes. Private lane names must stay out of telemetry."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "TODO · Sweep duration and 04:00Z deadline",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Requires start, completion and last-success timestamps plus a daily heartbeat, including days when no run starts. Alert when today's sweep is still incomplete after 04:00 UTC. Terminal spans cannot prove a missing run; alert blocked on engineOtel."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Recent archive sweep traces",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"libertos-convex\" && name =~ \"eve[.]job[.]archive_sweep .*\" }",
          "limit": 30,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceID"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Briefing drill-down",
                    "url": "/d/libertos-briefing-drilldown?var-traceId=${__value.raw}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    }
  ]
}
